Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.18 Encounter rate option in FIELDSTG_countBattleSteps

FIELDSTG_countBattleSteps runs on every footstep that can start a battle
(FIELDSTG_playStepSounds with canBattle). In an area with a map and a
BattleList it subtracts the area's rate (FIELDSTG_battleRates[count]) from
GAME.battleSteps and, at zero or less, starts a random battle of the area
(FIELDSTG_startAreaBattle) and rolls the next countdown. Only this countdown
is touched: scripted and forced battles (FIELDSTG_startEventBattle, the
stages' events 9000, the gauge and hidden-spot battles, boss fights) never
come through here.

The port decides what one footstep costs (dw3_port_pacing_encounter_step):

* 1x (default): the rate unchanged. The countdown, the RNG calls and the
  battle are bit-identical to a build without the patch.
* 0.5x: half the rate, the odd half step carried to the next footstep.
* Off: the footstep is ignored (no countdown, no roll), so no random battle
  can start. An area with the rate 2000 (BattleList.count 0, the table's
  "first step" entry) is a map-forced trigger and is left alone in every mode.

The port also logs each random battle with the number of footsteps that led
to it (dw3_port_pacing_encounter_started), which the replay tests check.

--- a/src/field/field_mode/battle.c
+++ b/src/field/field_mode/battle.c
@@ -2,6 +2,9 @@
    battles of the map's areas */
 
 #include "field/field_mode.h"
+#if PORT_HOST
+#include "port_pacing.h"
+#endif
 
 /* Rolls the steps to the next battle (GAME.battleSteps): under 0x100, or 0x100 to 0x4FF */
 void FIELDSTG_rollBattleSteps(void) {
@@ -46,9 +49,19 @@
         if (area != 0) {
             area--;
             rate = FIELDSTG_battleRates[FIELDSTG_state.battles->battles[area]->count];
+#if PORT_HOST
+            /* P6.18: the Encounter rate option scales the countdown of the
+             * random areas (0.5x) or skips the footstep (Off) */
+            if (!dw3_port_pacing_encounter_step(&rate)) {
+                return;
+            }
+#endif
             GAME.battleSteps -= rate;
             if (GAME.battleSteps <= 0) {
                 if (BATTLE_SETUP.randomBattles != 0) {
+#if PORT_HOST
+                    dw3_port_pacing_encounter_started();
+#endif
                     FIELDSTG_startAreaBattle();
                 }
                 FIELDSTG_rollBattleSteps();
